window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The deadly games are over, and the time has finally come for Taveon to take his rightful place as king. But nothing is ever simple in the Dark Fae realm.</p> <p>A strange and twisted curse befalls the court, assassins lurk behind every corner, and a dangerous new shapeshifter joins the academy, an alluring male who either wants me dead or in his bed.</p> <p>Maybe both.</p> <p>With the entire court under siege, it is up to me to find the cure to the curse. If I don't, the entire realm will descend into chaos.</p> <p>And I'll lose my mates forever.</p> <p><b><i>A Heart of Midnight</i></b><b> is the fifth full-length novel in a fantasy romance series and the second of Bree's story. Set inside the Dark Fae realm, it's packed full of danger, magic, and romance that doesn't require choosing.</b></p>"; 
